    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. everything just feels so empty lately. i look at my old posts and my old videos and it’s like i’m looking at a stranger. the person everyone actually liked, the one who actually mattered... that person is just gone. i'm just a ghost walking around in a body that doesnt even feel like mine anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
